- "Conditional yes" is a real outcome - capture it verbatim in the reason slot.
  "Haan lekin 4 baje ke baad" is useful information for the Roster Planner.
- Confirm rest-period compliance is the system's job, not the conversation's.
  Do not speculate aloud about whether they are allowed to take it.

CLOSING ON A YES
Repeat the shift back - date, shift, terminal, reporting time - and confirm
they have it. This is the one call where read-back is mandatory, because a
misheard OT commitment creates a gap nobody is expecting.
